# Check out text files with LF line endings on every platform.
#
# The scripts, launch files and robot descriptions run inside the Linux
# container (several via the ./src bind mount). With Git for Windows' default
# core.autocrlf=true they would otherwise be checked out with CRLF endings,
# and bash fails on them with "$'\r': command not found".
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
